      "observed": "The ESP32 GPIO7 pin, the third thermocouple interface's active-low CS pin, and the WS2812B's DIN pin are all connected to NET0004.",
      "expected": "The LED data input should have a separate GPIO from the thermocouple chip-select so the LED data signal and CS2 can be controlled independently.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "schematic",
          "quote": "GPIO7 ... NET0004; sheet /Microcontroller/, page 2/4."
        },
        {
