          "quote": "U10 ~{CS} ... NET0004; sheet /Thermocouples/, page 3/4."
        },
        {
          "source": "schematic",
          "quote": "D7 WS2812B DIN ... NET0004; sheet /Microcontroller/, page 2/4."
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Each chip has its own independent chip-select: ~{CS} (pin 6) on U2/U3/U4 goes to separate nets CS0/CS1/CS2."
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The LED data and thermocouple CS2 cannot be controlled independently. This can prevent reliable LED updates or interfere with selection of the third thermocouple channel.",
      "confidence": 0.94
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The WS2812B data input shares NET0004 with ESP32 GPIO7 and the third thermocouple's chip-select. This conflicts with the specified independent thermocouple chip-selects and likely compromises LED or sensor operation."
}

